# Dawnhand Dissident: "During your turn, you may cast creature spells from among cards you own exiled with this creature ..." - the
# permission is its controller's ("you", CR 109.5), and owning the card is not enough. Bot2 discards its Llanowar Elves to Vengeful
# Possession (cast on its own Walking Ballista); Bot1's Dissident exiles them from Bot2's graveyard. On Bot2's own turn six, with
# three +1/+1 counters on its Ballista and {G} open, Bot2 can't cast the Elves it owns: Bot1 controls the Dissident. The twin where
# Bot2 controls the Dissident and casts them is "...lets-its-controller-cast-only-the-cards-they-own".

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dawnhand Dissident
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Walking Ballista
Vengeful Possession
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Island x12

